### General
### Check API and database readiness
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Not found responses use Problem Details
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress}}/api/not-a-route
Accept: application/problem+json

### Authentication (Auth)
### Register a new user
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssword1"
}

### Login and receive a JWT token
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "alice",
  "password": "P@ssword1"
}

### Protected endpoints (use Authorization: Bearer {{token}})
### Get authenticated user info
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Accounts
### Create an account (requires auth)
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Checking"
}

### List accounts for the authenticated user
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a specific account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Balances
### Add a dated balance to an account (requires auth)
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-18",
  "amount": 123.45
}

### List balances for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update a dated balance
PUT {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/balances/{{balanceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-19",
  "amount": 150.00
}

### Delete a dated balance
DELETE {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/balances/{{balanceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pots and Goals
### Create a pot for an account
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/pots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Holiday"
}

### List pots for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/pots
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a specific pot
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/pots/{{potId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update a pot name and account
PUT {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/pots/{{potId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Summer holiday",
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}"
}

### Delete a pot and its goals
DELETE {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/pots/{{potId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a goal on a pot
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/pots/{{potId}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetAmount": 500.00,
  "dueDate": "2027-01-01"
}

### List goals for a pot
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/pots/{{potId}}/goals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update a goal
PUT {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/pots/{{potId}}/goals/{{goalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetAmount": 750.00,
  "dueDate": "2027-07-01"
}

### Delete a goal
DELETE {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/pots/{{potId}}/goals/{{goalId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add money to a pot from an account (creates a matching negative account balance)
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/pots/{{potId}}/contributions
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": null,
  "amount": 50.00,
  "date": "2026-10-19"
}

### List pot contributions
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/pots/{{potId}}/contributions
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update a contribution and its linked account debit
PUT {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/pots/{{potId}}/contributions/{{contributionId}}
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 75.00,
  "date": "2026-10-20"
}

### Delete a contribution and its linked account debit
DELETE {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/pots/{{potId}}/contributions/{{contributionId}}
Authorization: {{token}}

### Running (cumulative) balances for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/running-balances
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Schedules (recurring income/expenses)
### Create a schedule on an account
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Salary",
  "amount": 2000.00,
  "startDate": "2026-10-01",
  "frequency": 2,
  "isIncome": true
}

### List schedules for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/schedules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update and move a recurring schedule
PUT {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{targetAccountId}}",
  "name": "Updated salary",
  "amount": 2500.00,
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "frequency": 2,
  "isIncome": true
}

### Delete a recurring schedule
DELETE {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/schedules/{{scheduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Occurrences
### Create an occurrence (record actual income/expense)
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/occurrences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-01",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "isIncome": false,
  "scheduledItemId": null,
  "externalReference": "ext-123"
}

### List occurrences for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/occurrences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update and move a recorded occurrence
PUT {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/occurrences/{{occurrenceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{targetAccountId}}",
  "date": "2026-10-15",
  "amount": 125.00,
  "isIncome": false,
  "externalReference": "Updated description"
}

### Delete a recorded occurrence
DELETE {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/occurrences/{{occurrenceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reconcile an occurrence (apply to balances once)
POST {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/occurrences/{{occurrenceId}}/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Forecast
### Get forecast and Safe to Spend for an account
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}/forecast
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Financial Overview summary
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/financialoverview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Payday transfer plan inferred from recurring income and expenses
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/payday-plan
Authorization: {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Setup status
GET {{Finance_API_HostAddress_Https}}/api/setup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json